       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDNUM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 NUM1 PIC 9(5).
       01 NUM2 PIC 9(5).
       01 RESULT PIC 9(6).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT NUM1.
           ACCEPT NUM2.

           ADD NUM1 TO NUM2 GIVING RESULT.

           DISPLAY "SUM: " RESULT.
           STOP RUN.
